//
// # Arguments
//
// * `entry` - the entry.
//
// # Returns
//
// A buffer the caller must release with
// [`pamoja_buffer_free`](crate::pamoja_buffer_free), or null if `entry` is null.
//
// # Safety
//
// `entry` must be a live handle from a call that produced one, or null.
